msgstr "该打印配置当前继承全局内容；在下方编辑并保存后，它将拥有专属内容。"

msgid "Custom content of \"%s\". Use \"Restore default content\" to inherit the global content again."
msgstr "「%s」的专属内容。点「恢复默认内容」可回到继承全局内容。"

msgid "Lines are printed top to bottom in this order. The generate dialog switches the label content together with the print profile; a profile with its own copy uses it, the others use the global content."
msgstr "按此顺序自上而下打印。生成时标签内容随所选打印配置切换：有专属内容的配置用它，其余用全局内容。"

msgid "Label content saved to the print profile."
msgstr "已保存到打印配置的专属标签内容。"

msgid "Save label content"
msgstr "保存标签内容"

msgid "Revert this print profile to the inherited global content?"
msgstr "确定让该打印配置恢复继承全局内容？"

